msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Pagos"

msgid ""
"Outgoing payments to suppliers, with their reference and an approval step "
"before they leave."
msgstr ""
"Pagos salientes a proveedores, con su referencia y un paso de aprobación "
"antes de salir."

msgid ""
"Payments keeps the money that goes out of the business: what you pay a "
"supplier, a transfer or a refund that is not a sale's. Each payment gets its "
"own reference of the day and moves from draft to approved, sent and "
"completed, or is cancelled with its reason, and keeps who recorded it, who "
"approved it and when each step happened. You choose the account or the cash "
"it is paid from. It moves no money and talks to no bank: you mark each step "
"when it happened."
msgstr ""
"Pagos guarda el dinero que sale del negocio: lo que pagas a un proveedor, una "
"transferencia o un reembolso que no es de una venta. Cada pago lleva su "
"referencia del día y pasa de borrador a aprobado, enviado y completado, o se "
"cancela con su motivo, y guarda quién lo apuntó, quién lo aprobó y cuándo "
"pasó cada paso. Eliges la cuenta o la caja desde la que se paga. No mueve "
"dinero ni habla con ningún banco: marcas cada paso cuando ha ocurrido."

